red  territory for sure  Liz Selassie owns designer loft Bridal a  wedding dress shop in New York City  I think March is where it's gonna be  we're gonna be decimated much much  quieter Selassie is fielding constant  calls from panicked brides and their  mothers who are dealing with postponed  weddings we will work with those brides  we're holding a lot of dresses for girls  that have had to postpone we're all in  this together  [Music]  Kenzie ray McMullen a wedding  photographer in Florida he's also doing  her best to work with brides who she  says are mostly rescheduling for the  fall McMullen who was immune-compromised  also worries about her own health I have  a bride who is planning to go forward  with her wedding as far as we know right  now and I'm there for my brides but  going out to a wedding or any gathering  even if it's only 50 people is still  more dangerous for me  brides like reshoe told us health is  most important she's come to terms with  postponing her wedding and has a message  for other brides anything we can control  we Shu and her fiance are still  considering getting married on their  original date but with a much smaller  group we also talked to other couples  who expressed concerns over refunds and  rescheduling difficulties with their  venues the knot advises reading your  contract closely and calling a lawyer if  necessary for CBS this morning Meg  Oliver  New Jersey
 

